# Ad Intelligence — License

## Pattern library (this package)

Copyright (c) 2026 HarrisCrypto.

You may use, modify, and redistribute the **pattern blueprints, schemas,
retrieval scripts, and skill instructions** in this package under the terms
you choose when you publish your own fork (MIT recommended for open sale,
or a commercial license for paid distribution).

## Important — what this package does NOT include

This package does **not** redistribute third-party ad creatives, video files,
brand assets, or verbatim competitor copy scraped from Meta Ad Library,
TikTok Creative Center, Google Ads Transparency Center, Foreplay, MagicBrief,
or similar services.

If you ingest live ads into your private vector store:

1. Follow each platform’s Terms of Service and robots/API rules.
2. Prefer official APIs or licensed swipe-file vendors.
3. Do not ship scraped creatives inside a public GitHub skill unless you own
   the rights or have a redistribution license.
4. Store **your own structured breakdowns** (hooks, angles, schemas) — not
   the original media — when packaging for sale.

